  "rootAssessment": "Lead assents to the exact independently accepted O1-b phase/clock/host metadata and harness-sink implementation, true registered bounds, guarded P1 projection, direct source/outcome/marker ownership, one shared finalization deadline and immutable freeze. Owning tests, actual first-record/admission/noninheritance/error/normal and cancellation stall/reader/privacy/phase/profile/refusal controls, source113 and lexical mint431 pass. Actual timing overshoot is retained without M6 qualification; the driver digest fragment grants no full Q0/D13 envelope assent. Provider ComponentRole and later owning phase emissions remain gated; O1-c/O1-S/SOP6 remain separate. No inventory authored here: additive170 re-census/review/bind follows code presence unless another inventory binds first. Held trees/private413/real installation untouched; no push.",
